'''Bombergirl (Deadly)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] appearing on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' of every month. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Lone Cat and Kitten]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. It was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

