'''Difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Start the battle by spamming Dread Pirate Catleys. If all goes well, Bore will begin knocking them back into each other, creating a makeshift stack that will begin continuously knocking him back. Keep spamming Catleys until you max out on cash, then pivot over to spamming Dark Lazers. These units are very expensive, so you literally cannot afford to spam both without either a Rich Cat or Dark Lazer's Cost Down Talent. Bore should usually die right before making contact with the enemy base, supplying you with enough cash to let you spam both of your units again, and leaving you with a nice stack of Dark Lazers. As always, knock Bakoo out of her attack animation (only happens if Dark Lazer triggers the boss), then watch in awe as, with good enough luck, Dark Lazer completely shreds everything in sight.

